{"seq":3,"slug":"currency-hedging","title":"汇率风险与对冲","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/global-indexing/currency-hedging","wordCount":2291,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"汇率风险与对冲\">汇率风险与对冲</h1><blockquote>\n<p>汇率对跨境收益影响、对冲成本（利率平价）、何时对冲、中国 QDII/QDLP 实操。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨境投资的最终收益是资产收益与汇率变动的叠加，汇率因此成为独立于选股的第二条风险来源。对冲汇率的理论成本由抛补利率平价（CIP）决定，近似等于本外币利率差——这使得&quot;该不该对冲&quot;在数学上退化为一道成本收益题：当本币利率低于外币利率时，对冲美元敞口不仅不花钱反而收取利差。但现实成本会因基差、交易成本与展期风险偏离理论值。是否对冲最终取决于投资期限、货币集中度与对冲成本三个变量；对于长期持有且货币分散的投资者，汇率影响趋于中性，不必过虑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"汇率对跨境投资收益的影响\">汇率对跨境投资收益的影响</h2><p>当中国投资者购买海外资产时，最终收益由两部分构成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{total} = (1 + R_{foreign}) \\times (1 + R_{fx}) - 1 \\approx R_{foreign} + R_{fx}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{foreign}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是以外币计价的资产收益率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{fx}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是外币对人民币的升值率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"汇率影响的量化示例\">汇率影响的量化示例</h3><p>假设投资美国 S&amp;P 500：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>S&amp;P 500 收益（美元）</th>\n<th>美元/人民币变动</th>\n<th>人民币计价总收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>情景 A</td>\n<td>+15%</td>\n<td>+5%（美元升值）</td>\n<td>+20.75%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情景 B</td>\n<td>+15%</td>\n<td>-5%（美元贬值）</td>\n<td>+9.25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情景 C</td>\n<td>-10%</td>\n<td>+10%</td>\n<td>-1.0%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情景 D</td>\n<td>-10%</td>\n<td>-10%</td>\n<td>-19.0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键洞见</strong>：汇率变动可以将一个正收益变为负收益（情景 B → 如果美元贬值更多），也可以放大亏损（情景 D）。对于中国投资者，美元汇率波动对最终收益的影响可能与资产本身收益同等量级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"历史波动率对比\">历史波动率对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>年化波动率（近 10 年）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>S&amp;P 500</td>\n<td>~15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美元/人民币</td>\n<td>~4%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人民币计价 S&amp;P</td>\n<td>~16%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>汇率波动率虽然远低于股票，但由于与资产收益的相关性不确定，它增加了总波动率的不可预测性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"汇率对冲的成本-利率平价理论\">汇率对冲的成本：利率平价理论</h2><h3 id=\"抛补利率平价-covered-interest-rate-parity-cip\">抛补利率平价（Covered Interest Rate Parity, CIP）</h3><p>汇率对冲的理论成本由两国利率差决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>对冲成本</mtext><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{对冲成本} \\approx r_{domestic} - r_{foreign}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">对冲成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即人民币利率减去外币利率。</p>\n<p><strong>2026 年实际情况</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>货币对</th>\n<th>中国利率</th>\n<th>对方利率</th>\n<th>理论对冲成本</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人民币/美元</td>\n<td>~1.5%</td>\n<td>~4.5%</td>\n<td>-3.0%</td>\n<td>对冲&quot;赚钱&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人民币/欧元</td>\n<td>~1.5%</td>\n<td>~3.0%</td>\n<td>-1.5%</td>\n<td>对冲&quot;赚钱&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人民币/日元</td>\n<td>~1.5%</td>\n<td>~0.5%</td>\n<td>+1.0%</td>\n<td>对冲&quot;花钱&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>反直觉结论</strong>：当前环境下（2026 年），中国投资者对冲美元敞口的理论成本为<strong>负数</strong>——即对冲不仅不花钱，还能&quot;赚取&quot;约 3% 的年化利差收入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么现实中对冲成本不等于理论值\">为什么现实中对冲成本不等于理论值？</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏差来源</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基差（Basis）</td>\n<td>实际远期/掉期定价偏离 CIP，尤其在压力期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易成本</td>\n<td>买卖价差 + 展期成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>操作复杂度</td>\n<td>需要定期滚动对冲合约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不完美对冲</td>\n<td>资产价值变动导致对冲比率偏离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>额度限制</td>\n<td>QDII 对冲工具受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[理论对冲成本&lt;br/&gt;= 利率差] --&gt; B{实际偏差}&#10;    B --&gt; C[+ 基差]&#10;    B --&gt; D[+ 交易成本]&#10;    B --&gt; E[+ 展期风险]&#10;    C --&gt; F[实际对冲成本]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F\">graph LR\n    A[理论对冲成本&lt;br/&gt;= 利率差] --&gt; B{实际偏差}\n    B --&gt; C[+ 基差]\n    B --&gt; D[+ 交易成本]\n    B --&gt; E[+ 展期风险]\n    C --&gt; F[实际对冲成本]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"何时应该对冲汇率\">何时应该对冲汇率？</h2><p>这是跨境投资中最具争议的问题之一。学术和实务界的主流观点：</p>\n<h3 id=\"支持对冲的论据\">支持对冲的论据</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>论据</th>\n<th>逻辑</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>降低波动</td>\n<td>汇率增加的波动对长期收益无补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投资期限短</td>\n<td>短期内汇率均值回复来不及发挥</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对冲成本低</td>\n<td>当利率差对你有利时，对冲几乎免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负债匹配</td>\n<td>如果未来支出是人民币，应消除汇率敞口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"反对对冲的论据\">反对对冲的论据</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>论据</th>\n<th>逻辑</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>长期中性</td>\n<td>汇率长期围绕 PPP 波动，对冲反而错失回复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对冲成本</td>\n<td>正利差时对冲有显著成本（如对冲日元）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然对冲</td>\n<td>投资组合中多国货币互相抵消</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分散化</td>\n<td>汇率敞口本身提供组合分散化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>操作复杂</td>\n<td>个人投资者难以高效执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"实用决策框架\">实用决策框架</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q1{投资期限?} --&gt;|&lt; 3年| H[倾向对冲]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&gt; 10年| NH[倾向不对冲]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|3-10年| Q2{对冲成本?}&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|负成本/低成本| H&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|高成本 &gt;2%/年| NH&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|中等| Q3{组合货币集中度?}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|单一货币&gt;50%| H&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|多货币分散| NH\">graph TD\n    Q1{投资期限?} --&gt;|&lt; 3年| H[倾向对冲]\n    Q1 --&gt;|&gt; 10年| NH[倾向不对冲]\n    Q1 --&gt;|3-10年| Q2{对冲成本?}\n    Q2 --&gt;|负成本/低成本| H\n    Q2 --&gt;|高成本 &gt;2%/年| NH\n    Q2 --&gt;|中等| Q3{组合货币集中度?}\n    Q3 --&gt;|单一货币&gt;50%| H\n    Q3 --&gt;|多货币分散| NH</pre><h3 id=\"vanguard-的研究结论\">Vanguard 的研究结论</h3><p>Vanguard Research（2022）对全球汇率对冲的系统性研究结论：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>对冲约降低 25%–30% 的国际股票波动率</li>\n<li>对冲对长期收益几乎没有影响</li>\n<li>建议对冲比例为 50%–100%（取决于成本和投资期限）</li>\n<li>固定收益资产应该对冲；股票资产的最优对冲比例存在争议</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"中国投资者的跨境投资渠道\">中国投资者的跨境投资渠道</h2><h3 id=\"qdii-合格境内机构投资者\">QDII（合格境内机构投资者）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定义</td>\n<td>由基金公司代为投资海外市场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投资范围</td>\n<td>全球股票、债券、商品（受批准额度限制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率处理</td>\n<td>基金内部兑换，投资者以人民币申赎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对冲选择</td>\n<td>部分 QDII 基金提供对冲份额（H类）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>额度限制</td>\n<td>外管局审批，2026 年额度有所放宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型产品</td>\n<td>华夏纳斯达克100、易方达标普500</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"qdlp-qdie-合格境内有限合伙人-投资企业\">QDLP/QDIE（合格境内有限合伙人/投资企业）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定义</td>\n<td>高净值投资者通过私募基金投资海外</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门槛</td>\n<td>通常 100 万–300 万元起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投资范围</td>\n<td>比 QDII 更广（可投私募股权、对冲基金等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>试点城市</td>\n<td>上海、深圳、北京、青岛等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合对象</td>\n<td>高净值个人和家族办公室</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"港股通-etf-互联互通\">港股通/ETF 互联互通</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通道</td>\n<td>沪港通/深港通框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率处理</td>\n<td>自动以离岸汇率兑换，投资者无需另行操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对冲可能</td>\n<td>个人投资者基本无法单独对冲港币汇率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实际影响</td>\n<td>港币挂钩美元，实质上承担的是美元汇率风险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"各渠道对比\">各渠道对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>QDII ETF</th>\n<th>港股通</th>\n<th>QDLP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>门槛</td>\n<td>无（几百元起）</td>\n<td>50 万元</td>\n<td>100 万+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>费率</td>\n<td>0.5%-1.5%</td>\n<td>佣金+印花税</td>\n<td>1.5%-2%+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>额度限制</td>\n<td>有（可能限购）</td>\n<td>每日额度限制</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率风险</td>\n<td>有（通常不对冲）</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>有（可能对冲）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品种丰富度</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>港股为主</td>\n<td>最广</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流动性</td>\n<td>取决于产品</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（锁定期）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"汇率对冲的实操方法\">汇率对冲的实操方法</h2><h3 id=\"方法一-选择对冲型基金份额\">方法一：选择对冲型基金份额</h3><p>部分 QDII 基金同时提供 A 类（不对冲）和 H 类（对冲）份额：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mtext>费率</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_A = R_{foreign} + R_{fx} - \\text{费率}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">费率</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mtext>费率</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>对冲成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_H = R_{foreign} - \\text{费率} - \\text{对冲成本}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">费率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">对冲成本</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"方法二-自行使用外汇远期-掉期\">方法二：自行使用外汇远期/掉期</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>适用投资者</th>\n<th>门槛</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>银行远期结汇</td>\n<td>企业/高净值个人</td>\n<td>通常 10 万美元起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外汇期货</td>\n<td>机构投资者</td>\n<td>期货账户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外汇期权</td>\n<td>专业投资者</td>\n<td>高门槛</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>对普通个人投资者</strong>：直接自行对冲的可操作性极低。选择对冲型基金份额是最实际的方案。</p>\n<h3 id=\"方法三-自然对冲\">方法三：自然对冲</h3><p>如果投资者同时有美元收入（如海外工资）或美元负债（如海外留学费用），那么美元资产本身就构成&quot;自然对冲&quot;——不需要额外的金融操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"人民币汇率长期趋势的判断\">人民币汇率长期趋势的判断</h2><p>对于长期投资者（10 年以上），汇率趋势判断比短期对冲更重要：</p>\n<h3 id=\"购买力平价-ppp-视角\">购买力平价（PPP）视角</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>2026 年数据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>市场汇率</td>\n<td>约 7.2 USD/CNY</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PPP 汇率</td>\n<td>约 4.0-4.5（IMF 估算）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>含义</td>\n<td>人民币在 PPP 意义上被低估 ~40%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>PPP 理论预测长期内人民币应升值——但&quot;长期&quot;可能是 20-30 年，且有大量结构性因素（资本账户管制、生产力增速差异等）影响实际路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"巴拉萨-萨缪尔森效应\">巴拉萨-萨缪尔森效应</h3><p>发展中国家在经济追赶过程中，随着生产率提高，实际汇率趋于升值。中国过去 20 年的经验大体符合这一规律（人民币从 8.3 升值到 7.2），但未来是否继续取决于生产率增速差异能否维持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践建议\">实践建议</h2><p>对于中国个人投资者：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>不要过度担心汇率</strong>：如果投资期限 &gt;10 年，汇率波动长期趋于中性</li>\n<li><strong>多货币分散</strong>：同时配置美元、港币（挂钩美元）、欧元资产天然降低汇率风险</li>\n<li><strong>关注对冲成本</strong>：当前美元对冲成本为负（有利于对冲），可适当考虑</li>\n<li><strong>不做汇率投机</strong>：不要基于汇率预测做大额方向性押注</li>\n<li><strong>利用自然对冲</strong>：如果有海外支出需求，对应金额的海外资产配置就是天然对冲</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>关键洞见</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双重收益</td>\n<td>跨境收益 = 资产收益 + 汇率变动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对冲成本</td>\n<td>理论上等于利率差，2026 年对冲美元成本为负</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>何时对冲</td>\n<td>短期/单一货币集中/低成本 → 对冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QDII</td>\n<td>个人投资者最主要的海外配置渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然对冲</td>\n<td>有海外支出需求时，外币资产本身就是对冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长期观点</td>\n<td>&gt;10 年持有期，汇率影响趋于中性，不必过虑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"汇率风险与对冲","id":"汇率风险与对冲"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"汇率对跨境投资收益的影响","id":"汇率对跨境投资收益的影响"},{"level":3,"text":"汇率影响的量化示例","id":"汇率影响的量化示例"},{"level":3,"text":"历史波动率对比","id":"历史波动率对比"},{"level":2,"text":"汇率对冲的成本：利率平价理论","id":"汇率对冲的成本-利率平价理论"},{"level":3,"text":"抛补利率平价（Covered Interest Rate Parity, CIP）","id":"抛补利率平价-covered-interest-rate-parity-cip"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么现实中对冲成本不等于理论值？","id":"为什么现实中对冲成本不等于理论值"},{"level":2,"text":"何时应该对冲汇率？","id":"何时应该对冲汇率"},{"level":3,"text":"支持对冲的论据","id":"支持对冲的论据"},{"level":3,"text":"反对对冲的论据","id":"反对对冲的论据"},{"level":3,"text":"实用决策框架","id":"实用决策框架"},{"level":3,"text":"Vanguard 的研究结论","id":"vanguard-的研究结论"},{"level":2,"text":"中国投资者的跨境投资渠道","id":"中国投资者的跨境投资渠道"},{"level":3,"text":"QDII（合格境内机构投资者）","id":"qdii-合格境内机构投资者"},{"level":3,"text":"QDLP/QDIE（合格境内有限合伙人/投资企业）","id":"qdlp-qdie-合格境内有限合伙人-投资企业"},{"level":3,"text":"港股通/ETF 互联互通","id":"港股通-etf-互联互通"},{"level":3,"text":"各渠道对比","id":"各渠道对比"},{"level":2,"text":"汇率对冲的实操方法","id":"汇率对冲的实操方法"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：选择对冲型基金份额","id":"方法一-选择对冲型基金份额"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：自行使用外汇远期/掉期","id":"方法二-自行使用外汇远期-掉期"},{"level":3,"text":"方法三：自然对冲","id":"方法三-自然对冲"},{"level":2,"text":"人民币汇率长期趋势的判断","id":"人民币汇率长期趋势的判断"},{"level":3,"text":"购买力平价（PPP）视角","id":"购买力平价-ppp-视角"},{"level":3,"text":"巴拉萨-萨缪尔森效应","id":"巴拉萨-萨缪尔森效应"},{"level":2,"text":"实践建议","id":"实践建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"中国指数投资格局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/global-indexing/china-index-landscape"},"next":{"title":"定投与一次性投入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/implementation/dca-lump-sum"}}